From 11e56639630cb385a11f95e79d5476f1e4bb982f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chandavath <rcrajagopal@habana.ai>
Date: Wed, 11 Dec 2024 12:57:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-210370] agent: integrated common verify functions

Integrated emb common fit verify, fit rsa, fit regions
to verify the fit loaded in SRAM.

Removed the redundant verification functions and files.

Added some security functions to align with emb cmn mods.

Change-Id: Ibb83c4115871138740e46046e8df42dc4c380bab
Signed-off-by: chandavath <rcrajagopal@habana.ai>
---

